1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,205
Nalanda ke khandahar mein jale hue chawal kyun mile?

2
00:00:03,205 --> 00:00:06,766
Sawaal chhota lagta hai, par isme poori kahani chhupi hai.

3
00:00:06,766 --> 00:00:09,971
Bihar ki mitti ke neeche, mitti ke jaar mile.

4
00:00:09,971 --> 00:00:13,177
Unke andar chawal ke daane the. Kaale, koyle jaise,

5
00:00:13,177 --> 00:00:15,669
aur bahut purane. Kisi rasoi mein nahi,

6
00:00:15,669 --> 00:00:17,450
ek vidyalaya ke khandahar mein.

7
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:21,234
Yeh daane ASI ne nikaale. ASI yaani Archaeological Survey of India,

8
00:00:21,234 --> 00:00:24,675
woh sarkari sanstha jo purani jagahon ki khudai karti hai.

9
00:00:24,675 --> 00:00:27,427
Unke mutabik yeh chawal 12vi sadi ke hain.

10
00:00:27,427 --> 00:00:30,868
Aaj bhi yeh Nalanda ke site museum mein rakhe hain.

11
00:00:30,868 --> 00:00:33,620
Inhe pakane ke liye nahi jalaya gaya tha.

12
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,340
Inhe aag ne jalaya tha.

13
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:39,589
Aapne shayad suna hoga ki Nalanda ki library 3 mahine tak jalti rahi.

14
00:00:39,589 --> 00:00:42,858
WhatsApp par, reels mein, yeh baat har jagah ghoomti hai.

15
00:00:42,858 --> 00:00:45,800
Par kya kisi purane granth mein yeh likha hai?

16
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:48,088
Ya yeh baad mein judi kahani hai?

17
00:00:48,088 --> 00:00:51,030
Is video mein hum yahi dhoondhenge, sabut ke saath.

18
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:53,304
Hum chalenge Tibet ke granthon se,

19
00:00:53,304 --> 00:00:57,472
China ke ek yatri ke bayan tak. Phir ASI ki khudai,

20
00:00:57,472 --> 00:01:00,882
raakh ki parton aur Persian itihaas ki kitaab tak.

21
00:01:00,882 --> 00:01:05,051
Har kadam par hum saaf batayenge. Kya granth mein likha hai,

22
00:01:05,051 --> 00:01:08,840
kya mitti se mila hai, aur kya sirf lok-katha hai.

23
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:12,865
Pehle chalte hain us Nalanda mein, jise granthon ne yaad rakha.

24
00:01:12,865 --> 00:01:16,890
Nalanda ek mahavihara tha. Mahavihara yaani bada Buddhist math aur vidyalaya,

25
00:01:16,890 --> 00:01:20,183
jahan bhikshu rehte bhi the aur padhte bhi the.

26
00:01:20,183 --> 00:01:22,745
Door-door se vidyarthi yahan seekhne aate the.

27
00:01:22,745 --> 00:01:26,770
Yeh uss zamane ki sabse mashhoor jagahon mein gina jaata tha.

28
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:29,718
China se ek yatri aaya, naam tha Xuanzang,

29
00:01:29,718 --> 00:01:31,930
jinhe Hiuen Tsang bhi kehte hain.

30
00:01:31,930 --> 00:01:34,878
Woh lambi aur mushkil yatra karke Nalanda pahuncha.

31
00:01:34,878 --> 00:01:38,932
Yahan woh 5 saal ruka. Usne Buddhist tark aur darshan padha,

32
00:01:38,932 --> 00:01:41,512
aur Panini ka Sanskrit vyakaran bhi seekha.

33
00:01:41,512 --> 00:01:44,460
Uske likhe bayan aaj bhi padhe jaate hain.

34
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:48,258
Xuanzang ne apne guru Shilabhadra se Yoga shastra seekha. Socho,

35
00:01:48,258 --> 00:01:52,436
ek videshi vidyarthi, diye ki roshni mein, pothiyan padh raha hai.

36
00:01:52,436 --> 00:01:54,714
Pothi yaani haath se likhi kitaab.

37
00:01:54,714 --> 00:01:58,512
Uss zamane mein har kitaab haath se likhi jaati thi.

38
00:01:58,512 --> 00:02:02,310
Yahi pothiyan aage chalkar is kahani ka dil banti hain.

39
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:06,918
Tibet ke itihaas granth ek library ka naam lete hain, Dharmaganja.

40
00:02:06,918 --> 00:02:09,431
Iska matlab hai, dharm ka bazaar.

41
00:02:09,431 --> 00:02:14,877
Yeh baat Sumpa Khenpo naam ke Tibetan vidwan ki kitaab mein milti hai.

42
00:02:14,877 --> 00:02:18,647
Usme kai manzil wali badi imaaratein bataayi gayi hain.

43
00:02:18,647 --> 00:02:21,160
Naam the Ratnasagara, Ratnodadhi aur Ratnaranjaka.

44
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:24,915
In granthon ke hisaab se Ratnodadhi 9 manzil ooncha tha.

45
00:02:24,915 --> 00:02:28,670
Ismein sabse pavitra pothiyan rakhi jaati thi, jaise Prajnaparamita Sutra.

46
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:31,673
Par yaad rakhiye, yeh granth ka bayan hai.

47
00:02:31,673 --> 00:02:36,930
Khudai mein abhi tak aisi 9 manzil wali imaarat zameen se nahi nikli hai.

48
00:02:36,930 --> 00:02:39,764
Ab socho, raat ka waqt hai. Ooncha bhawan,

49
00:02:39,764 --> 00:02:42,598
khidkiyon se diyon ki roshni aa rahi hai.

50
00:02:42,598 --> 00:02:46,141
Andar bhikshu chupchaap pothiyan likh rahe hain, sambhal rahe hain.

51
00:02:46,141 --> 00:02:49,329
Yeh tasveer humare mann mein granthon se aati hai.

52
00:02:49,329 --> 00:02:50,392
Ab dekhte hain,

53
00:02:50,392 --> 00:02:53,580
mitti is tasveer ke baare mein kya kehti hai.

54
00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:56,079
Granth ek baat hai, mitti alag baat.

55
00:02:56,079 --> 00:03:00,362
Archaeology yaani zameen khod kar purane logon ke nishaan dhoondhne ka vigyan.

56
00:03:00,362 --> 00:03:03,931
Nalanda ke khandahar sadiyon tak mitti ke neeche dabe rahe.

57
00:03:03,931 --> 00:03:07,501
Bahar se yeh bas mitti ke oonche dher lagte the.

58
00:03:07,501 --> 00:03:11,070
Kisi ko andaza nahi tha ki neeche kya chhupa hai.

59
00:03:11,070 --> 00:03:14,635
Phir ASI ne yahan baakayda khudai shuru ki.

60
00:03:14,635 --> 00:03:17,755
Yeh kaam 1915 se 1937 tak chala.

61
00:03:17,755 --> 00:03:22,658
Mazdoor aur archaeologist mil kar, parat dar parat, mitti hatate gaye.

62
00:03:22,658 --> 00:03:27,115
Dheere dheere neeche se laal eenton ki deewarein ubharne lagin.

63
00:03:27,115 --> 00:03:30,680
Jaise koi shehar neend se jaag raha ho.

64
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:34,094
Jo nikla, woh kisi chhote math jaisa nahi tha.

65
00:03:34,094 --> 00:03:36,749
Seedhi line mein bane kai vihar the,

66
00:03:36,749 --> 00:03:39,404
aur unke saamne bade eenton ke mandir.

67
00:03:39,404 --> 00:03:42,818
Sab kuch ek soche samjhe naqshe par bana tha.

68
00:03:42,818 --> 00:03:45,853
Jaise kisi ne pehle poora plan banaya ho,

69
00:03:45,853 --> 00:03:47,370
phir eenth rakhi ho.

70
00:03:47,370 --> 00:03:50,166
Vihar yaani woh imaarat jahan bhikshu rehte the.

71
00:03:50,166 --> 00:03:53,662
Beech mein khula aangan, aur aas paas chhote chhote kamre.

72
00:03:53,662 --> 00:03:57,158
Inhi kamron mein bhikshu rehte, padhte aur so jaate the.

73
00:03:57,158 --> 00:03:59,604
Aaj jab aap inme khade hote hain,

74
00:03:59,604 --> 00:04:03,100
toh lagta hai jaise abhi koi pothi lekar andar aayega.

75
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:06,935
Aur phir khudai karne walon ko kuch aur dikha. Kaali mitti.

76
00:04:06,935 --> 00:04:10,073
Raakh ki moti parat. Jali hui lakdi ki kadiyan.

77
00:04:10,073 --> 00:04:13,211
Aisi eentein jo garmi se rang badal chuki thi.

78
00:04:13,211 --> 00:04:16,698
Yeh sab ek hi baat ki gawaahi de raha tha.

79
00:04:16,698 --> 00:04:18,790
Yahan kabhi badi aag lagi thi.

80
00:04:18,790 --> 00:04:21,567
ASI ke mutabik yahan 11 vihar mile,

81
00:04:21,567 --> 00:04:23,947
aur kai bade eenton ke mandir.

82
00:04:23,947 --> 00:04:27,913
Yeh sab ek beech ki line par sajaye gaye the.

83
00:04:27,913 --> 00:04:30,293
Yaani Nalanda ek imaarat nahi tha.

84
00:04:30,293 --> 00:04:33,863
Woh ek poore shehar jaisa campus tha, jahan padhai,

85
00:04:33,863 --> 00:04:36,640
ibaadat aur rehna, sab saath chalta tha.

86
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:39,939
ASI ne sabse pehle jis vihar ki khudai ki,

87
00:04:39,939 --> 00:04:43,972
wahan stratigraphy ki gayi. Stratigraphy yaani mitti ki parton ko padhna,

88
00:04:43,972 --> 00:04:46,171
bilkul kitaab ke panno ki tarah.

89
00:04:46,171 --> 00:04:49,471
Neeche wali parat purani hoti hai, upar wali nayi.

90
00:04:49,471 --> 00:04:52,770
Har parat ek alag daur ki kahani sunati hai.

91
00:04:52,770 --> 00:04:56,244
Is vihar mein 9 alag alag daur ki banawat mili. Matlab,

92
00:04:56,244 --> 00:04:59,401
yeh vihar baar baar bana, toota, aur phir se bana.

93
00:04:59,401 --> 00:05:02,559
Har peedhi ne purani deewar ke upar nayi deewar uthayi.

94
00:05:02,559 --> 00:05:04,454
Jaise ghar ki marammat hoti hai,

95
00:05:04,454 --> 00:05:06,980
waise hi sadiyon tak yahan kaam chalta raha.

96
00:05:06,980 --> 00:05:10,596
Yeh baat bahut zaroori hai. Nalanda ek din mein nahi bana.

97
00:05:10,596 --> 00:05:12,568
Aur is sabut se lagta hai,

98
00:05:12,568 --> 00:05:15,198
shayad ek din mein khatam bhi nahi hua.

99
00:05:15,198 --> 00:05:17,499
Sadiyon tak log yahan marammat karte rahe.

100
00:05:17,499 --> 00:05:19,471
Matlab nuksaan pehle bhi aaye honge,

101
00:05:19,471 --> 00:05:22,430
aur log phir se jod kar khade hue honge.

102
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:25,924
Ab un jale chawalon par lautte hain. Jaar mein rakhe chawal,

103
00:05:25,924 --> 00:05:27,829
jo aag mein kaale pad gaye.

104
00:05:27,829 --> 00:05:31,005
ASI ke museum mein yeh namoone aaj bhi rakhe hain,

105
00:05:31,005 --> 00:05:33,229
copper plate, shilalekh aur sikkon ke saath.

106
00:05:33,229 --> 00:05:37,040
Yeh woh sabut hai jise aap apni aankhon se dekh sakte hain.

107
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:41,872
ASI ke mutabik yeh raakh ek bade aur phaile hue jalne ki nishaani hai.

108
00:05:41,872 --> 00:05:45,323
Yaani aag sach mein lagi thi. Yeh baat kahani nahi,

109
00:05:45,323 --> 00:05:49,119
mitti ka sabut hai. Par aag kitne din chali, kisne lagayi,

110
00:05:49,119 --> 00:05:52,570
yeh mitti nahi batati. Yahin se bahas shuru hoti hai.

111
00:05:52,570 --> 00:05:55,196
Ab aate hain sabse mashhoor daavon par,

112
00:05:55,196 --> 00:05:58,197
jo aap baar baar sunte hain. Ek daava,

113
00:05:58,197 --> 00:06:01,573
ki library mahino tak jalti rahi. Aur ek daava,

114
00:06:01,573 --> 00:06:04,199
ki wahan anginat kitaabein thi. Dekhte hain,

115
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:06,824
in daavon ke peeche sabut kya hai,

116
00:06:06,824 --> 00:06:08,700
aur itihaskar kya kehte hain.

117
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:11,977
Kaha jaata hai Nalanda mein 90 lakh pothiyan thi.

118
00:06:11,977 --> 00:06:14,890
Par itihaskar D.N. Jha jaise vidwan kehte hain,

119
00:06:14,890 --> 00:06:18,532
yeh sirf ek ginti hai. Uss zamane ki koi suchi,

120
00:06:18,532 --> 00:06:21,445
koi register nahi milta. Asli sankhya kitni thi,

121
00:06:21,445 --> 00:06:23,630
yeh aaj bhi koi nahi jaanta.

122
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:27,309
Wahin kuch log kehte hain, itni oonchi aur badi imaaratein thi,

123
00:06:27,309 --> 00:06:29,316
toh pothiyan bhi bahut rahi hongi.

124
00:06:29,316 --> 00:06:31,322
Yeh baat samajh mein aati hai.

125
00:06:31,322 --> 00:06:35,001
Par bahut hona aur ek tay ginti hona, inme fark hai.

126
00:06:35,001 --> 00:06:38,680
Granth imaaraton ka zikr karte hain, ginti ka sabut nahi milta.

127
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:41,344
Ab 3 mahine wali baat. Itihaskar kehte hain,

128
00:06:41,344 --> 00:06:45,339
us daur ka mukhya granth vihar ke tootne ka zikr karta hai.

129
00:06:45,339 --> 00:06:48,669
Par 3 mahine tak jalne ki baat usme nahi milti.

130
00:06:48,669 --> 00:06:51,665
Yeh ginti baad ki lok kahaniyon mein aati hai,

131
00:06:51,665 --> 00:06:53,330
purane likhe itihaas mein nahi.

132
00:06:53,330 --> 00:06:55,185
Chronicle yaani itihaas ki diary,

133
00:06:55,185 --> 00:06:58,895
jo raja ya sena ke daur mein likhi jaati thi.

134
00:06:58,895 --> 00:07:01,491
Aisi hi ek kitaab hai Tabaqat-i Nasiri.

135
00:07:01,491 --> 00:07:03,717
Ise Persian itihaskar Minhaj-i-Siraj ne likha.

136
00:07:03,717 --> 00:07:08,540
Isme Bihar ke ek kile jaise vihar par hamle ka zikr milta hai.

137
00:07:08,540 --> 00:07:12,143
Minhaj likhte hain ki Bakhtiyar Khalji ki sena ne woh jagah jeeti.

138
00:07:12,143 --> 00:07:13,644
Wahan bahut saari kitaabein mili.

139
00:07:13,644 --> 00:07:17,847
Sena ne aise log dhoondhe jo bata sakein ki kitaabon mein kya likha hai.

140
00:07:17,847 --> 00:07:19,048
Par granth kehta hai,

141
00:07:19,048 --> 00:07:21,750
unhe padhne wale tab tak maare ja chuke the.

142
00:07:21,750 --> 00:07:24,929
Aur yahin itihaskar ek baat par atak jaate hain.

143
00:07:24,929 --> 00:07:27,755
Kitaab us jagah ko bas Bihar kehti hai.

144
00:07:27,755 --> 00:07:30,935
Kuch vidwan maante hain ki yeh Nalanda tha. D.N.

145
00:07:30,935 --> 00:07:32,701
Jha jaise itihaskar kehte hain,

146
00:07:32,701 --> 00:07:35,880
yeh paas ka Odantapuri vihar bhi ho sakta hai.

147
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:39,090
Odantapuri bhi ek bada mahavihara tha, Nalanda ke paas hi.

148
00:07:39,090 --> 00:07:41,016
Woh bhi kile jaisa mazboot tha.

149
00:07:41,016 --> 00:07:44,548
Isliye kitaab ka varnan us par bhi fit ho sakta hai.

150
00:07:44,548 --> 00:07:47,437
Matlab, Nalanda mein aag ka sabut mitti mein hai.

151
00:07:47,437 --> 00:07:49,363
Par kis hamle mein, kis din,

152
00:07:49,363 --> 00:07:51,610
yeh abhi bhi bahas ka mudda hai.

153
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:55,240
Ab ek aur kahani suniye, jo Tibet se aati hai.

154
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:57,054
Yeh itihaas nahi, legend hai,

155
00:07:57,054 --> 00:08:01,047
yaani lok katha jiska koi pakad mein aane wala sabut nahi.

156
00:08:01,047 --> 00:08:06,491
Par yeh dikhati hai ki log is aag ko sadiyon tak kaise yaad rakhte rahe,

157
00:08:06,491 --> 00:08:07,580
kaise sunate rahe.

158
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:13,442
Tibetan lekhak Taranatha ne likha ki kuch apmaanit sadhuon ne 9 saal tak tapasya ki.

159
00:08:13,442 --> 00:08:15,786
Tapasya poori hone par woh laute.

160
00:08:15,786 --> 00:08:19,304
Unhone mantra se bhari raakh har taraf bikher di.

161
00:08:19,304 --> 00:08:20,867
Aur kahani kehti hai,

162
00:08:20,867 --> 00:08:23,993
usi raakh se library mein aag lag gayi.

163
00:08:23,993 --> 00:08:27,510
Kahani mein jaadu hai, par dard asli lagta hai.

164
00:08:27,510 --> 00:08:29,209
Ab ek aankhon dekha bayan.

165
00:08:29,209 --> 00:08:31,927
Tibet ke bhikshu Dharmasvamin 1235 mein Nalanda pahunche.

166
00:08:31,927 --> 00:08:34,985
Yeh hamle ke kai saal baad ki baat hai.

167
00:08:34,985 --> 00:08:37,364
Unhone dekha ki Nalanda toota hua tha,

168
00:08:37,364 --> 00:08:39,742
par poori tarah khatam nahi hua tha.

169
00:08:39,742 --> 00:08:42,800
Unki jeevani mein yeh bayan aaj bhi milta hai.

170
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:46,058
Wahan abbot Rahula Shribhadra ab bhi padha rahe the.

171
00:08:46,058 --> 00:08:48,955
Abbot yaani math ke pramukh. Khandaharon ke beech,

172
00:08:48,955 --> 00:08:52,213
kuch vidyarthi unke saamne baithe the. Granth kehta hai,

173
00:08:52,213 --> 00:08:56,558
Nalanda tab apne purane roop ka bas ek saaya reh gaya tha.

174
00:08:56,558 --> 00:08:58,730
Phir bhi padhai chal rahi thi.

175
00:08:58,730 --> 00:09:01,478
Yeh bayan kahani ko badal deta hai.

176
00:09:01,478 --> 00:09:05,012
Agar 1235 mein bhi yahan padhai chal rahi thi,

177
00:09:05,012 --> 00:09:09,331
toh Nalanda ek jhatke mein khatam nahi hua. Shayad dheere dheere,

178
00:09:09,331 --> 00:09:12,472
nuksaan par nuksaan se, yeh khaali hota gaya.

179
00:09:12,472 --> 00:09:15,220
Kuch itihaskar isi taraf ishara karte hain.

180
00:09:15,220 --> 00:09:19,047
Toh ab tak kya sach mein pata hai? Nalanda tha,

181
00:09:19,047 --> 00:09:22,108
bahut bada tha, aur usme aag lagi thi.

182
00:09:22,108 --> 00:09:24,787
Yeh mitti aur granth, dono batate hain.

183
00:09:24,787 --> 00:09:27,466
Par kuch sawaal aaj bhi khule hain.

184
00:09:27,466 --> 00:09:30,910
Aur shayad yahi Nalanda ka sabse bada rahasya hai.

185
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:34,233
Sabse bada sawaal, Dharmaganja kahan tha? Granthon mein naam hai,

186
00:09:34,233 --> 00:09:35,895
oonchi imaaraton ka zikr hai.

187
00:09:35,895 --> 00:09:39,550
Par khudai wale ilaake mein abhi tak yeh tay nahi hua

188
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:42,541
ki library ki imaaratein theek kis jagah khadi thi.

189
00:09:42,541 --> 00:09:45,200
Shayad woh abhi bhi mitti ke neeche hai.

190
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:47,616
Aur ek sawaal, kaunsi pothiyan kho gayi?

191
00:09:47,616 --> 00:09:49,686
Unki koi poori suchi nahi bachi.

192
00:09:49,686 --> 00:09:53,483
Hum nahi jaante ki un shelfon par kya kya likha tha.

193
00:09:53,483 --> 00:09:57,279
Jo gyaan Xuanzang jaise yatri seekh kar le gaye, woh bacha.

194
00:09:57,279 --> 00:10:00,730
Jo yahin reh gaya, uske naam bhi hum nahi jaante.

195
00:10:00,730 --> 00:10:03,385
Aaj aap Nalanda, Bihar jaa sakte hain.

196
00:10:03,385 --> 00:10:06,420
UNESCO ne ise World Heritage Site maana hai,

197
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:10,213
yaani poori duniya ki saajhi virasat. Laal eenton ke vihar,

198
00:10:10,213 --> 00:10:13,627
oonche mandir aur lambe raste aaj bhi khade hain.

199
00:10:13,627 --> 00:10:17,420
Subah ki dhoop mein yeh jagah alag hi dikhti hai.

200
00:10:17,420 --> 00:10:20,229
Site museum mein woh jale chawal zaroor dekhiye,

201
00:10:20,229 --> 00:10:23,038
jo is kahani ki shuruaat the. Copper plate,

202
00:10:23,038 --> 00:10:25,847
sikke aur mitti ke bartan bhi wahin hain.

203
00:10:25,847 --> 00:10:29,008
Phir kisi vihar ke kamre mein khade hokar socho.

204
00:10:29,008 --> 00:10:32,870
Yahin kabhi koi bhikshu diye ki roshni mein pothi padhta tha.

205
00:10:32,870 --> 00:10:35,858
Aur jab aap kisi deewar par kaala nishaan dekhein,

206
00:10:35,858 --> 00:10:37,517
toh ek pal ruk jaiye.

207
00:10:37,517 --> 00:10:40,505
Ho sakta hai woh usi aag ki yaad ho.

208
00:10:40,505 --> 00:10:42,829
Guide ki kahani bhi suniye, mazaa aayega.

209
00:10:42,829 --> 00:10:46,480
Par saath mein ek sawaal zaroor poochiye. Iska sabut kya hai?

210
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:49,408
Agli baar hum chalenge Odantapuri ki talash mein.

211
00:10:49,408 --> 00:10:53,067
Woh mahavihara jiska naam is kahani mein baar baar aaya,

212
00:10:53,067 --> 00:10:55,995
par jiska thikana aaj bhi bahas mein hai.

213
00:10:55,995 --> 00:10:58,922
Kya woh sach mein Nalanda ke paas tha?

214
00:10:58,922 --> 00:11:01,850
Wahan kya mila hai? Sabut ke saath dekhenge.

215
00:11:01,850 --> 00:11:04,216
Ab aapse ek aasaan sawaal.

216
00:11:04,216 --> 00:11:09,422
Aapne Nalanda ke 3 mahine jalne ki baat kahan suni thi,

217
00:11:09,422 --> 00:11:12,735
school, ghar ya WhatsApp? Comment mein bataiye.

218
00:11:12,735 --> 00:11:15,574
Aur agar aap Nalanda gaye hain,

219
00:11:15,574 --> 00:11:19,833
toh bataiye wahan aapko sabse zyada kya yaad raha.
